  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Having a dedicated adviser that can provide a mix of technical and governance education expertise to BEK and government is an excellent investment to ensure a meaningful policy and political engagement in the education space. Samartha&#x2019;s programme-funded CBS Education Adviser will this be a key position to support our girls&#x2019; education commitments (both global and within our campaign goal 5)</narrative>
  </description>
